#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_property_access
msgid ""
". Aucun code\n"
"                    n'est conservé ici : il vit dans l'appareil. Si vous êtes locataire, la porte de\n"
"                    votre logement ne change pas de mécanisme sans votre consentement (art. 1934 C.c.Q.)."
msgstr ""
". No code\n"
"                    is kept here: it lives in the device. If you are a lessee, the lock of\n"
"                    your dwelling does not change without your consent (art. 1934 CCQ)."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_property_deliveries_access
msgid "Accès"
msgstr "Access"

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_portal.field_bf_property_visit__access_pass_state
msgid "Accès du visiteur"
msgstr "Visitor's access"

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_property_deliveries_access
msgid "Accès jusqu'à"
msgstr "Access until"

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_portal.field_bf_property_visit__access_pass_id
msgid "Accès temporaire"
msgstr "Temporary access"

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_property_deliveries_access
msgid ""
"Annoncer quelqu'un prévient l'organisation. Une porte ne s'ouvre pour lui que si vous\n"
"                    cochez l'accès temporaire : les portes communes, pour la visite seulement. Ce que vous\n"
"                    inscrivez ici concerne une personne qui n'a rien consenti : le journal ne garde que ce\n"
"                    qui sert, et il se purge tout seul."
msgstr ""
"Announcing someone notifies the organisation. A door only opens for them if "
"you tick temporary access: the common doors, for the visit only. What you "
"enter here is about a person who has consented to nothing: the log keeps "
"only what is needed, and it purges itself."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_property_access
msgid ""
"Aucun accès à votre nom. Si vous venez d'emménager, il apparaîtra le jour de"
" votre arrivée."
msgstr ""
"No access in your name. If you have just moved in, it will appear on the day"
" you arrive."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_portal/models/bf_property_visit.py:0
msgid "Cette organisation ne permet pas de donner un accès aux visiteurs."
msgstr "This organisation does not allow giving access to visitors."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_portal/models/bf_property_visit.py:0
msgid "Départ confirmé de l'hôte."
msgstr "The host's move-out was confirmed."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_property_access
msgid "Fraction"
msgstr "Fraction"

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_property_access
msgid "Immeuble"
msgstr "Building"

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_portal/models/bf_property_visit.py:0
msgid "Indiquez la fraction : l'accès dépend de l'immeuble."
msgstr "Enter the fraction: access depends on the building."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_portal/models/bf_property_visit.py:0
msgid "L'immeuble n'a aucune porte commune où donner un accès."
msgstr "The building has no common door to give access to."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_portal/models/bf_property_visit.py:0
msgid "La plage de la visite est déjà passée."
msgstr "The visit's time window has already passed."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_property_deliveries_access
msgid ""
"Le visiteur est annoncé, mais l'accès temporaire n'a pas pu être donné : l'organisation ne le\n"
"                    permet pas, la plage est passée, l'immeuble n'a pas de porte commune reliée, ou vous\n"
"                    habitez plusieurs immeubles et la fraction n'est pas choisie."
msgstr ""
"The visitor is announced, but temporary access could not be given: the "
"organisation does not allow it, the window has passed, the building has no "
"connected common door, or you live in several buildings and no unit was "
"chosen."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_my_home_property_access
msgid "Les portes que vous pouvez ouvrir, et avec quoi"
msgstr "The doors you can open, and with what"

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access_portal.field_bf_property_visit__access_pass_state
msgid ""
"Lu en élévation : l'hôte n'a pas accès aux accès temporaires eux-mêmes."
msgstr ""
"Read with elevated rights: the host has no access to the temporary access "
"records themselves."

#. module: bf_property_access_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_portal.portal_property_deliveries_access
msgid "Lui donner un accès temporaire aux portes communes"
msgstr "Give them temporary access to the common doors"

